uot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ac ci&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cp bi ig ih ii ij&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;3c7a&quot; class=&quot;pw-subtitle-paragraph jw jc jd bg b jx jy jz ka kb kc kd ke kf kg kh ki kj kk kl cx eb&quot;&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;km&quot;&gt;My questions were answered with myths, misconceptions and dangerous falsehoods&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figure class=&quot;oy oz pa pb pc pd ov ow paragraph-image&quot;&gt;&lt;div role=&quot;button&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; class=&quot;pe pf fr pg bi ph&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fw fx fy ao fz ga gb gc gd speechify-ignore&quot;&gt;Press enter or click to view image in full size&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ov ow ox&quot;&gt;&lt;picture&gt;&lt;source srcset=&quot;https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/format:webp/1*56Zdzo8ohlu4eViwuM_btw.jpeg 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/format:webp/1*56Zdzo8ohlu4eViwuM_btw.jpeg 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/format:webp/1*56Zdzo8ohlu4eViwuM_btw.jpeg 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/format:webp/1*56Zdzo8ohlu4eViwuM_btw.jpeg 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/format:webp/1*56Zdzo8ohlu4eViwuM_btw.jpeg 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/format:webp/1*56Zdzo8ohlu4eViwuM_btw.jpeg 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/format:webp/1*56Zdzo8ohlu4eViwuM_btw.jpeg 1400w&quot; sizes=&quot;(min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px&quot; type=&quot;image/webp&quot;&gt;&lt;source data-testid=&quot;og&quot; srcset=&quot;https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/1*56Zdzo8ohlu4eViwuM_btw.jpeg 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/1*56Zdzo8ohlu4eViwuM_btw.jpeg 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/1*56Zdzo8ohlu4eViwuM_btw.jpeg 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/1*56Zdzo8ohlu4eViwuM_btw.jpeg 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/1*56Zdzo8ohlu4eViwuM_btw.jpeg 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/1*56Zdzo8ohlu4eViwuM_btw.jpeg 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/1*56Zdzo8ohlu4eViwuM_btw.jpeg 1400w&quot; sizes=&quot;(min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;bi gl pi c&quot; width=&quot;700&quot; height=&quot;467&quot; loading=&quot;eager&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/picture&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;pj fm pk ov ow pl pm bg b bh ab eb&quot;&gt;Image: Pexels/Sanket Mishra&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;2e41&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph pn po jd pp b jx pq pr ps ka pt pu pv ha pw px py hd pz qa qb hg qc qd qe qf ia bl qg&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;m qh qi qj bp qk ql qm qn qo fr&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;nyone seeking health information or advice should be extremely cautious with OpenAI’s ChatGPT app. I tested the so-called generative artificial intelligence (AI) app on some basic health questions, and while it offered accurate (if brief and incomplete) answers to some of my questions, it failed in multiple cases, repeating common myths, misconceptions and falsehoods that ranged from unhelpful to outright dangerous.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;245d&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph pn po jd pp b jx pq pr ps ka pt pu pv ha pw px py hd pz qa qb hg qc qd qe qf ia bl&quot;&gt;ChatGPT knows it’s far from perfect—it told me so, as you’ll see below. But since it provides no citations or links to further information, it’s impossible to know where it gets its info, good or bad.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;fc5e&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph pn po jd pp b jx pq pr ps ka pt pu pv ha pw px py hd pz qa qb hg qc qd qe qf ia bl&quot;&gt;Below are the questions I posed, and ChatGPT’s answers, word-for-word in their entirety. False and misleading passages are &lt;strong class=&quot;pp je&quot;&gt;highlighted&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong class=&quot;pp je&quot;&gt;in bold&lt;/strong&gt;, followed by&lt;strong class=&quot;pp je&quot;&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;the reality in each case with a link to an article for more information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;8922&quot; class=&quot;qp qq jd bg qr gw qs ef gx gy qt eh gz ha qu hb hc hd qv he hf hg qw hh hi qx bl&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;an&quot;&gt;What is normal human body temperature?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;blockquote class=&quot;qy qz ra&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;229f&quot; class=&quot;pn po rb pp b jx pq pr ps ka pt pu pv ha pw px py hd pz qa qb hg qc qd qe qf ia bl&quot;&gt;The normal human body temperature is typically &lt;strong class=&quot;pp je&quot;&gt;around 98.6 degrees Fahrenheit&lt;/strong&gt; (37 degrees Celsius) when measured orally. However, individual body temperature can vary slightly throughout the day and can also depend on factors…&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description><link>https://medium.com/the-generator/chatgpt-gives-false-and-even-dangerous-health-advice-4408212407d8</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://medium.com/the-generator/chatgpt-gives-false-and-even-dangerous-health-advice-4408212407d8</guid><pubDate>Fri, 19 May 2023 13:30:33 GMT</pubDate><author>Robert Roy Britt</author></item><item><title>Why I Signed the “Pause Giant AI Experiments” Petition</title><description>&lt;div class=&quot;m&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;m&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;m&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;section&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fw iq ir is it ho&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;speechify-ignore m&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;iu m&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ac ci&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cp bi ih ii ij ik&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cx ac ft&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bn&quot; role=&quot;tooltip&quot;&gt;&lt;div tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;bf&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;iv r iw im ix ft aq&quot;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; width=&quot;16px&quot; height=&quot;16px&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 64 64&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill=&quot;#FFC017&quot; d=&quot;m39.637 40.831-5.771 15.871a1.99 1.99 0 0 1-3.732 0l-5.771-15.87a2.02 2.02 0 0 0-1.194-1.195L7.298 33.866a1.99 1.99 0 0 1 0-3.732l15.87-5.771a2.02 2.02 0 0 0 1.195-1.194l5.771-15.871a1.99 1.99 0 0 1 3.732 0l5.771 15.87a2.02 2.02 0 0 0 1.194 1.195l15.871 5.771a1.99 1.99 0 0 1 0 3.732l-15.87 5.771a2.02 2.02 0 0 0-1.195 1.194&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bg b bh ab eb&quot;&gt;Member-only story&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ib iy iz ja jb&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ac ci&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cp bi ih ii ij ik&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;e7a0&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph og oh je oi b oj ok ol om on oo op oq hb or os ot he ou ov ow hh ox oy oz pa ib bl&quot;&gt;The “spirit” is right; the body has many flaws&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure class=&quot;pe pf pg ph pi pj pb pc paragraph-image&quot;&gt;&lt;div role=&quot;button&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; class=&quot;pk pl fr pm bi pn&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fw fx fy ao fz ga gb gc gd speechify-ignore&quot;&gt;Press enter or click to view image in full size&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pb pc pd&quot;&gt;&lt;picture&gt;&lt;source srcset=&quot;https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/format:webp/0*-PMKdaP1psaNsvEH 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/format:webp/0*-PMKdaP1psaNsvEH 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/format:webp/0*-PMKdaP1psaNsvEH 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/format:webp/0*-PMKdaP1psaNsvEH 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/format:webp/0*-PMKdaP1psaNsvEH 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/format:webp/0*-PMKdaP1psaNsvEH 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/format:webp/0*-PMKdaP1psaNsvEH 1400w&quot; sizes=&quot;(min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px&quot; type=&quot;image/webp&quot;&gt;&lt;source data-testid=&quot;og&quot; srcset=&quot;https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/0*-PMKdaP1psaNsvEH 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/0*-PMKdaP1psaNsvEH 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/0*-PMKdaP1psaNsvEH 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/0*-PMKdaP1psaNsvEH 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/0*-PMKdaP1psaNsvEH 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/0*-PMKdaP1psaNsvEH 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/0*-PMKdaP1psaNsvEH 1400w&quot; sizes=&quot;(min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;bi gl po c&quot; width=&quot;700&quot; height=&quot;467&quot; loading=&quot;eager&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/picture&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;pp fm pq pb pc pr ps bg b bh ab eb&quot;&gt;Photo by &lt;a class=&quot;ah pt&quot; href=&quot;https://unsplash.com/@alvaroserrano?utm_source=medium&amp;amp;utm_medium=referral&quot; rel=&quot;noopener ugc nofollow&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Álvaro Serrano&lt;/a&gt; on &lt;a class=&quot;ah pt&quot; href=&quot;https://unsplash.com/?utm_source=medium&amp;amp;utm_medium=referral&quot; rel=&quot;noopener ugc nofollow&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Unsplash&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;4b08&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph og oh je oi b oj ok ol om on oo op oq hb or os ot he ou ov ow hh ox oy oz pa ib bl&quot;&gt;Last Tuesday, I received from the Future of Life Institute an email asking me to sign a &lt;a class=&quot;ah pt&quot; href=&quot;https://futureoflife.org/open-letter/pause-giant-ai-experiments/?utm_source=pocket_saves&quot; rel=&quot;noopener ugc nofollow&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;petition to pause giant AI experiments&lt;/a&gt;. When I signed the letter, the organizers asked us to keep it confidential until its publication moment arrived. At that time, I didn’t expect it to raise so much news, comments, articles, and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;2355&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph og oh je oi b oj ok ol om on oo op oq hb or os ot he ou ov ow hh ox oy oz pa ib bl&quot;&gt;Shortly after its publication, I was contacted by a couple of news outlets, one from Argentina and the other one from Mexico, to participate in their live programs and give my opinion there.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;a737&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph og oh je oi b oj ok ol om on oo op oq hb or os ot he ou ov ow hh ox oy oz pa ib bl&quot;&gt;It was then that I realized the FLI’s letter was indeed a high-impact initiative.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;92c4&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph og oh je oi b oj ok ol om on oo op oq hb or os ot he ou ov ow hh ox oy oz pa ib bl&quot;&gt;Though in the end, I decided to sign it, I also found many statements in the letter I disagree with, so in this post, I want to make the record straight and give the reasons for and against the letter. I encourage you to read the letter itself as well; it’s not that long.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;f27c&quot; class=&quot;pu pv je bg pw px py pz gy qa qb qc ha qd qe qf qg qh qi qj qk ql qm qn qo qp bl&quot;&gt;Why now?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;15bc&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph og oh je oi b oj qq ol om on qr op oq hb qs os ot he qt ov ow hh qu oy oz pa ib bl&quot;&gt;It’s important to be aware that the sense of urgency in the open letter is not about Artificial Intelligence in general; it’s about the recent development and release of what’s been called “Generative AI” or GenAI for short.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description><link>https://medium.com/data-science/why-i-signed-the-pause-giant-ai-experiments-petition-e9711f672d18</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://medium.com/data-science/why-i-signed-the-pause-giant-ai-experiments-petition-e9711f672d18</guid><pubDate>Sat, 01 Apr 2023 03:37:02 GMT</pubDate><author>Rafe Brena, Ph.D.</author></item></channel></rss>